// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — AWL Sublist 1
window.A1_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"analyze – benefit","cards":[{"w":"analyze","p":"v.","d":"to study something carefully to understand it","c":"分析","s":"After examining the data, he needs to analyze the results for trends.","t":"在檢查資料後，他需要分析趨勢結果。"},{"w":"analysis","p":"n.","d":"a careful study of something to understand it","c":"分析","s":"His analysis of the novel was insightful and thorough.","t":"他對小說的分析既有洞見又全面。"},{"w":"analytical","p":"adj.","d":"good at studying things carefully and logically","c":"分析的","s":"She has an analytical mind, always breaking problems down.","t":"她有分析的頭腦，總是分解問題。"},{"w":"approach a task/mission","p":"v.","d":"to start dealing with a task or job","c":"靠近，處理","s":"As the deadline neared, he began to approach the task with more urgency.","t":"隨著截止日期的臨近，他開始更緊迫地處理這項任務。"},{"w":"approach","p":"n.","d":"a way of doing or dealing with something","c":"方法","s":"The new approach to teaching has received mixed feedback.","t":"新的教學方法收到了不同的回饋。"},{"w":"contract","p":"n.","d":"a written legal agreement","c":"合約","s":"After lengthy negotiations, the two companies finally signed a contract.","t":"經過冗長的談判，這兩家公司終於簽署了一份合約。"},{"w":"contract","p":"v.","d":"to make a legal agreement to do work","c":"簽訂","s":"The artist will contract with a new gallery for her upcoming exhibition.","t":"藝術家將與一家新畫廊簽訂合約，為她即將到來的展覽做準備。"},{"w":"area","p":"n.","d":"a part of a place, town or country","c":"區域","s":"The area around the river is known for its rich biodiversity.","t":"河流周圍的區域以其豐富的生物多樣性而著稱。"},{"w":"assess","p":"v.","d":"to judge how good, bad or important something is","c":"評估","s":"It's important to assess the risks before making a decision.","t":"在做決定之前，評估風險非常重要。"},{"w":"assessment","p":"n.","d":"a judgment of how good or bad something is","c":"評估","s":"The teacher's assessment of the student's work was fair.","t":"老師對學生的工作的評估是公正的。"},{"w":"assume","p":"v.","d":"to think something is true without proof","c":"假設","s":"We cannot assume that everyone agrees with this perspective that gender is binary.","t":"我們不能假設每個人都同意性別二元論這種觀點。"},{"w":"assumption","p":"n.","d":"something you think is true without proof","c":"假設","s":"Under the assumption of constant growth in AI, the company invested heavily in data mining and statistic analysis.","t":"在AI持續增長的假設下，公司大舉投資在數據挖掘與數據分析。"},{"w":"authorize","p":"v.","d":"to give official permission for something","c":"授權","s":"Only the director can authorize such a large expenditure.","t":"只有總監可以授權這麼大的開支。"},{"w":"authorized","p":"adj.","d":"having official permission","c":"已授權的","s":"This is an authorized biography, written with the subject's input.","t":"這是一部已授權的傳記，是在當事人的參與下寫的。"},{"w":"unauthorized","p":"adj.","d":"done without official permission","c":"未經授權的","s":"unauthorized access to the building is strictly prohibited.","t":"嚴禁未經授權進入該建築。"},{"w":"authority","p":"n.","d":"an expert on a subject","c":"權威","s":"She's an authority on medieval history.","t":"她是中世紀歷史的權威。"},{"w":"the authorities","p":"n.","d":"the police or government groups in charge","c":"當局","s":"the authorities have issued a warning about the storm.","t":"當局已就暴風雨發出警告。"},{"w":"available","p":"adj.","d":"free to use, buy or get","c":"可用的","s":"Are there any tickets available for the concert?","t":"音樂會還有票嗎？"},{"w":"benefit from","p":"v.","d":"to get something good from something","c":"人從事務中受益","s":"Many students benefit from extra tutoring.","t":"許多學生從額外的輔導中受益。"},{"w":"benefit","p":"v.","d":"to be good or helpful for someone","c":"事務造福人","s":"The extra tutoring benefit many students who struggle to learn a foreign language.","t":"額外的輔導造福許多在學習外語方面遇到困難的學生。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"benefit – derive from = originate from","cards":[{"w":"benefit","p":"n.","d":"a good or helpful result","c":"好處","s":"The benefit of exercising regularly are numerous.","t":"定期鍛煉的好處很多。"},{"w":"beneficial","p":"adj.","d":"helpful; having a good effect","c":"有益的","s":"It's beneficial to take breaks when studying for long periods.","t":"長時間學習時，休息是有益的。"},{"w":"concept","p":"n.","d":"a general idea","c":"概念","s":"The concept of freedom varies from culture to culture.","t":"自由的概念因文化而異。"},{"w":"consist of","p":"v.","d":"to be made up of certain parts","c":"由...組成","s":"The team consist of experts from different fields.","t":"該團隊由來自不同領域的專家組成。"},{"w":"consistent","p":"adj.","d":"always the same; not changing","c":"一致的","s":"Her performance has been consistent throughout the year.","t":"她的表現在整個年度都是一致的。"},{"w":"consistency","p":"n.","d":"the quality of always being the same","c":"一致性","s":"There's a lack of consistency in his arguments.","t":"他的論點缺乏一致性。"},{"w":"constitution","p":"n.","d":"the basic laws of a country","c":"憲法","s":"The country's constitution guarantees freedom of speech.","t":"該國的憲法保障言論自由。"},{"w":"constitutional","p":"adj.","d":"allowed by or about a constitution","c":"憲法的","s":"This law may be a constitutional violation.","t":"這項法律可能違反憲法。"},{"w":"context","p":"n.","d":"the situation or words around something","c":"上下文","s":"In this context, the word has a different meaning.","t":"在這個上下文中，這個詞有不同的意思。"},{"w":"contextual","p":"adj.","d":"related to the situation or words around something","c":"與上下文有關的","s":"contextual information is essential for understanding the statement.","t":"與上下文相關的資訊對於理解聲明至關重要。"},{"w":"contract","p":"n.","d":"a written legal agreement","c":"合同","s":"They signed a contract for the sale of the house.","t":"他們簽了一個出售房子的合同。"},{"w":"create","p":"v.","d":"to make something new","c":"創建","s":"Artists create works that reflect their emotions and ideas.","t":"藝術家創建反映他們的情感和想法的作品。"},{"w":"creation","p":"n.","d":"something new that someone makes","c":"創作","s":"The sculpture is this world-renowned artist's latest creation.","t":"這座雕塑是這位世界知名藝術家的最新創作。"},{"w":"creature","p":"n.","d":"any living animal","c":"生物","s":"The forest is home to many unique creature.","t":"森林是許多獨特生物的家。"},{"w":"creative","p":"adj.","d":"good at thinking of new ideas","c":"有創造力的","s":"She's a very creative designer with innovative concepts.","t":"她是一個非常有創造力的設計師，有很創新的概念。"},{"w":"creativity","p":"n.","d":"the ability to make new and original things","c":"創造力","s":"Innovation requires creativity.","t":"創新需要創造力。"},{"w":"data","p":"n.","d":"facts or numbers collected to study","c":"數據","s":"The data collected will be used for further research.","t":"收集的資料將用於進一步的研究。"},{"w":"define","p":"v.","d":"to explain exactly what something means","c":"定義","s":"How do you define success?","t":"你如何定義成功？"},{"w":"definition","p":"n.","d":"a sentence that explains what a word means","c":"定義","s":"The dictionary provides a clear definition of each word.","t":"字典為每個詞提供了清晰的定義。"},{"w":"derive from = originate from","p":"v.","d":"to come from something","c":"來源於","s":"The word \"piano\" derives from the Italian language.","t":"“鋼琴”一詞來源於義大利語。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"be derived from – imported","cards":[{"w":"be derived from","p":"adj.","d":"to come from or be made from something","c":"衍生的","s":"This oil is derived from plants.","t":"這種油是從植物中提取的。"},{"w":"distribute","p":"v.","d":"to give things out to many people","c":"分發","s":"The organization will distribute food to those in need.","t":"該組織將向有需要的人分發食物。"},{"w":"distribution","p":"n.","d":"the way things are shared or given out","c":"分配","s":"The distribution of resources is a critical issue.","t":"資源的分配是一個關鍵問題。"},{"w":"economy","p":"n.","d":"the money, trade and business of a country","c":"經濟","s":"The global economy has been affected by the pandemic.","t":"全球經濟受到了大流行的影響。"},{"w":"economic","p":"adj.","d":"about money, trade and business","c":"經濟的","s":"The economic situation in the country is improving.","t":"該國的經濟形勢正在改善。"},{"w":"economical","p":"adj.","d":"saving money; not costing much","c":"省錢的","s":"It's more economical to buy groceries in bulk.","t":"批量購買雜貨更為省錢。"},{"w":"economics","p":"n.","d":"the study of money, trade and business","c":"經濟學","s":"He's studying economics at the university.","t":"他在大學學習經濟學。"},{"w":"environment","p":"n.","d":"the air, water and land around us","c":"環境","s":"Protecting the environment should be a global priority.","t":"保護環境應該是全球的優先事項。"},{"w":"establish","p":"v.","d":"to start or create something that will last","c":"建立","s":"They hope to establish a new school in the area.","t":"他們希望在該地區建立一所新學校。"},{"w":"established","p":"adj.","d":"well known and accepted for a long time","c":"知名的","s":"The museum is an established institution in the city.","t":"該博物館是城市的一個知名的機構。"},{"w":"establishment","p":"n.","d":"the act of starting something; an organization","c":"建造，機構","s":"The establishment of new parks benefits the community.","t":"新公園的建立對社區有益。"},{"w":"estimate","p":"v.","d":"to guess a number or amount","c":"估計","s":"We need to estimate the cost of the project.","t":"我們需要估計專案的成本。"},{"w":"estimated","p":"adj.","d":"guessed, not exact","c":"估計的","s":"The estimated arrival time is 5 pm.","t":"估計的到達時間是下午5點。"},{"w":"It is estimated that","p":"phr.","d":"people believe the number is about...","c":"據估計","s":"It is estimated that over 1,000 people attended the event.","t":"據估計有超過1000人參加了這個活動。"},{"w":"evidence","p":"n.","d":"facts or things that show something is true","c":"證據","s":"The detective searched for evidence at the crime scene.","t":"偵探在犯罪現場尋找證據。"},{"w":"evident","p":"adj.","d":"clear and easy to see","c":"明顯的","s":"It was evident that she was tired after the trip.","t":"她旅行後很累是明顯的"},{"w":"export","p":"v.","d":"to sell goods to another country","c":"出口","s":"The country plans to export more agricultural products.","t":"該國計畫出口更多的農產品。"},{"w":"exported","p":"adj.","d":"sold and sent to another country","c":"出口的","s":"The exported goods reached their destination safely.","t":"出口的貨物安全到達目的地。"},{"w":"import","p":"v.","d":"to buy goods from another country","c":"進口","s":"They import electronics from several Asian countries.","t":"他們從幾個亞洲國家進口電子產品。"},{"w":"imported","p":"adj.","d":"brought in from another country","c":"進口的","s":"She loves drinking imported wines from Europe.","t":"她喜歡喝從歐洲進口的葡萄酒。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"factor – involve","cards":[{"w":"factor","p":"n.","d":"one of the things that cause a result","c":"因素","s":"There are several factor that contributed to the success.","t":"有幾個因素促成了這次的成功。"},{"w":"finance","p":"n.","d":"the management of money","c":"財務","s":"He works in the field of finance.","t":"他在財務領域工作。"},{"w":"financial","p":"adj.","d":"about money","c":"財務的","s":"The company faced financial difficulties.","t":"該公司面臨財務困難。"},{"w":"formula","p":"n.","d":"a rule written in letters, numbers or symbols","c":"公式","s":"The scientist is working on a new chemical formula.","t":"科學家正在研究新的化學公式。"},{"w":"function","p":"n.","d":"the job or purpose something has","c":"功能","s":"The function of the heart is to pump blood.","t":"心臟的功能是泵血。"},{"w":"functional","p":"adj.","d":"useful and working well","c":"有功能的","s":"This tool is both decorative and functional.","t":"這個工具既有裝飾性又有功能性。"},{"w":"identify","p":"v.","d":"to recognize and name someone or something","c":"識別","s":"She was able to identify the thief from a lineup.","t":"她能夠從一群人中識別出小偷。"},{"w":"identified","p":"adj.","d":"recognized and named","c":"已識別的","s":"The identified suspect was taken into custody.","t":"被識別的嫌疑犯被拘留。"},{"w":"identity","p":"n.","d":"who or what a person is","c":"身份","s":"He struggles with his cultural identity.","t":"他為自己的文化身份感到困惑。"},{"w":"identification","p":"n.","d":"a document that shows who you are","c":"身份識別","s":"Please show your identification at the checkpoint.","t":"請在檢查點出示您的身份證明。"},{"w":"income","p":"n.","d":"money you get from work or investments","c":"收入","s":"His annual income has increased this year.","t":"他今年的年收入增加了。"},{"w":"indicate","p":"v.","d":"to show or point to something","c":"指示","s":"The signs indicate the way to the emergency exit.","t":"標誌指示通往緊急出口的路。"},{"w":"indication","p":"n.","d":"a sign that something may happen or is true","c":"跡象","s":"The forecast gives an indication of rain tomorrow.","t":"天氣預報顯示明天有雨的跡象。"},{"w":"individual","p":"n.","d":"a single person","c":"個體","s":"Each individual has their own set of beliefs.","t":"每個個體都有自己的信仰體系。"},{"w":"individual","p":"adj.","d":"for each person or thing separately","c":"個別的","s":"They addressed individual concerns during the meeting.","t":"他們在會議上解決了個別的關注點。"},{"w":"interpret","p":"v.","d":"to change spoken words into another language","c":"口譯","s":"The role of the interpreter is to interpret the speaker's words.","t":"口譯員的角色是解釋說話者的話。"},{"w":"interpret","p":"v.","d":"to explain the meaning of something","c":"詮釋","s":"She tried to interpret the poem for the class.","t":"她試著為全班詮釋這首詩。"},{"w":"interpretation","p":"n.","d":"the act of translating spoken words","c":"口譯；詮釋","s":"She did the interpretation during the meeting.","t":"她在會議中進行了口譯"},{"w":"interpretation","p":"n.","d":"an explanation of the meaning of something","c":"解釋","s":"His interpretation of the painting was quite original.","t":"他對這幅畫的解釋非常獨特。"},{"w":"involve","p":"v.","d":"to include something as a necessary part","c":"涉及","s":"The project involve a lot of time and resources.","t":"該專案涉及大量時間和資源。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"be involved in – procedure","cards":[{"w":"be involved in","p":"phr","d":"to take part in an activity","c":"參與","s":"She is involved in various charitable activities.","t":"她參與了各種慈善活動。"},{"w":"issue","p":"v.","d":"to officially give out or print something","c":"發行","s":"They plan to issue a new edition of the book.","t":"他們計畫發行這本書的新版本。"},{"w":"issue","p":"n.","d":"an important problem or topic","c":"問題","s":"The main issue discussed was the budget.","t":"討論的主要問題是預算。"},{"w":"labor","p":"n.","d":"hard physical work","c":"勞動","s":"Manual labor is highly valued in some professions.","t":"在某些職業中，手工勞動被高度重視。"},{"w":"laborer","p":"n.","d":"a worker who does hard physical work","c":"勞工","s":"The laborer worked long hours under the sun.","t":"勞工在太陽下工作了很長時間。"},{"w":"legal","p":"adj.","d":"allowed by the law","c":"合法的","s":"It's not legal to park here. It's prohibited.","t":"在這裡停車是不合法的。這是禁止的"},{"w":"illegal","p":"adj.","d":"not allowed by the law","c":"非法的","s":"Selling counterfeit goods is illegal. People  with violation of the regulation will be sentenced to 3 years of jail","t":"出售假冒商品是非法的。觸犯該法規的人會被判三年徒刑"},{"w":"legislation","p":"n.","d":"laws made by a government","c":"立法","s":"The new legislation aims to protect the environment by illegalizing proaching endangered species.","t":"新的立法旨在保護環境，藉由使盜獵瀕臨物種非法化。"},{"w":"legislator","p":"n.","d":"a person who makes laws","c":"立法者","s":"The legislator proposed a bill to support local businesses.","t":"立法者提出了一項支持本地企業的法案。"},{"w":"major","p":"adj.","d":"very important or big","c":"主要的","s":"The museum underwent a major renovation.","t":"博物館經歷了一次主要的翻新。"},{"w":"major in","p":"phr","d":"to study a subject as your main subject at university","c":"主修","s":"She decided to major in biology.","t":"她決定主修生物學。"},{"w":"method","p":"n.","d":"a way of doing something","c":"方法","s":"They adopted a new method to solve the problem.","t":"他們採用了一種新方法來解決這個問題。"},{"w":"occur","p":"v.","d":"to happen","c":"發生","s":"Accidents can occur if precautions are not taken.","t":"如果不採取預防措施，可能會發生事故。"},{"w":"occurrence","p":"n.","d":"something that happens","c":"事件","s":"The sudden occurrence left everyone in shock.","t":"突然的事件讓每個人都震驚。"},{"w":"percent","p":"n.","d":"one part in every hundred","c":"百分比","s":"Only ten percent of the applicants passed the exam.","t":"只有十分之一的申請人通過了考試。"},{"w":"percentage","p":"n.","d":"an amount shown as part of 100","c":"百分比","s":"A large percentage of the budget is allocated for research.","t":"大部分預算分配給了研究。"},{"w":"period","p":"n.","d":"a length of time","c":"時期","s":"The Renaissance was a significant period in European history.","t":"文藝復興是歐洲歷史上的一個重要時期。"},{"w":"policy","p":"n.","d":"an official plan or set of rules","c":"政策","s":"The company's new policy allows remote work.","t":"公司的新政策允許遠端工作。"},{"w":"principle","p":"n.","d":"a basic rule or belief","c":"原則","s":"He lives by the principle of honesty.","t":"他按照誠實的原則生活。"},{"w":"procedure","p":"n.","d":"the correct steps for doing something","c":"程式","s":"The medical procedure is complex.","t":"醫療程式很複雜。"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"process – specific","cards":[{"w":"process","p":"n.","d":"a series of steps to do something","c":"過程","s":"The process of making wine is intricate.","t":"製作葡萄酒的過程很複雜。"},{"w":"require","p":"v.","d":"to need something","c":"需要","s":"This task will require your full attention.","t":"這項任務需要你的全部注意力。"},{"w":"required","p":"adj.","d":"needed; must be done","c":"所需的","s":"All the required documents have been submitted.","t":"所有所需的檔都已提交。"},{"w":"requirement","p":"n.","d":"something that you must have or do","c":"要求","s":"One of the job requirement is proficiency in English.","t":"工作要求之一是精通英語。"},{"w":"research","p":"v.","d":"to study something to find new facts","c":"研究","s":"She decided to research the topic thoroughly.","t":"她決定徹底研究這個話題。"},{"w":"research","p":"n.","d":"careful study to find new facts","c":"研究","s":"His research on the subject won an award.","t":"他對該主題的研究獲得了獎項。"},{"w":"researcher","p":"n.","d":"a person who studies something to find new facts","c":"研究員","s":"The researcher spent years in the Amazon studying plant life.","t":"研究員在亞馬遜研究植物生活多年。"},{"w":"make a response to N","p":"phr.","d":"to reply to something","c":"對…做回應","s":"The president made a response to the recent allegations.","t":"總統對最近的指控做出了回應。"},{"w":"in response to","p":"phr.","d":"as a reply to something","c":"作為對...的回應","s":"in response to the crisis, the government took immediate action.","t":"作為對危機的回應，政府採取了立即行動。"},{"w":"respond to","p":"phr.","d":"to reply or react to something","c":"回應","s":"How did she respond to your question?","t":"她如何回應你的問題？"},{"w":"play a significant role","p":"phr.","d":"to be very important in something","c":"發揮重要作用","s":"Proper nutrition plays a significant role in an athlete's performance.","t":"適當的營養在運動員的表現中發揮重要作用。"},{"w":"section","p":"n.","d":"one part of something","c":"部分","s":"Please read this section of the report for more details.","t":"請閱讀報告的這一部分以獲取更多詳細資訊。"},{"w":"sector","p":"n.","d":"a part of the economy or society","c":"部門","s":"The tech sector has seen rapid growth this year.","t":"今年，技術部門經歷了快速增長。"},{"w":"significant","p":"adj.","d":"large or important","c":"顯著的","s":"There has been a significant increase in sales.","t":"銷售額有了顯著增長。"},{"w":"significance","p":"n.","d":"the importance of something","c":"重要性","s":"The significance of this discovery cannot be understated.","t":"這一發現的重要性不可低估。"},{"w":"be similar to","p":"phr.","d":"almost the same as something","c":"與...相似","s":"Her style is similar to that of a famous painter.","t":"她的風格與著名畫家相似。"},{"w":"similarly","p":"adv.","d":"in the same way","c":"同樣地","s":"He's an expert in mathematics, and similarly, she excels in physics.","t":"他是數學專家，同樣地，她擅長物理。"},{"w":"source","p":"n.","d":"where something comes from","c":"來源","s":"The river is the main source of water for the town.","t":"河流是小鎮的主要水源。"},{"w":"resource","p":"n.","d":"something useful, like water, oil or money","c":"資源","s":"The country has abundant natural resource.","t":"該國擁有豐富的自然資源。"},{"w":"specific","p":"adj.","d":"exact and clear; certain","c":"特定的","s":"Can you give a more specific example?","t":"你能給一個更具體的例子嗎？"}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"specifically – counterfeit","cards":[{"w":"specifically","p":"adv.","d":"for one special purpose; clearly","c":"具體地","s":"He asked specifically for a chocolate cake.","t":"他具體要求一個巧克力蛋糕。"},{"w":"specify","p":"v.","d":"to say exactly what you want","c":"指定","s":"Please specify the number of items you want.","t":"請指定您想要的物品數量。"},{"w":"structure","p":"n.","d":"the way the parts of something are put together","c":"結構","s":"The structure of the building is sound.","t":"建築的結構是穩固的。"},{"w":"structural","p":"adj.","d":"about the structure of something","c":"結構的","s":"There are some structural issues with the bridge.","t":"這座橋有一些結構問題。"},{"w":"structured","p":"adj.","d":"well organized; planned in parts","c":"有結構的","s":"The course is well-structured.","t":"課程結構良好。"},{"w":"theory","p":"n.","d":"an idea that explains why something happens","c":"理論","s":"The scientist proposed a new theory on the origin of the universe.","t":"科學家提出了一個關於宇宙起源的新理論。"},{"w":"theoretical","p":"adj.","d":"based on ideas, not practice","c":"理論的","s":"His approach is more theoretical than practical.","t":"他的方法更加理論化，而不是實際的。"},{"w":"vary","p":"v.","d":"to change or be different","c":"變化","s":"Prices can vary depending on the season.","t":"價格可能會根據季節變化。"},{"w":"various","p":"adj.","d":"many different kinds of","c":"各種各樣的","s":"The exhibition showcased various types of artwork.","t":"展覽展示了各種各樣的藝術品。"},{"w":"varied","p":"adj.","d":"including many different kinds","c":"多種多樣的","s":"The menu was varied and offered something for everyone.","t":"菜單多種多樣，適合每個人。"},{"w":"a variety of","p":"phr.","d":"many different kinds of","c":"各種各樣的","s":"The shop sells a variety of products.","t":"商店出售各種各樣的產品。"},{"w":"variable","p":"n.","d":"something that can change","c":"變數","s":"There are too many variable to predict the outcome accurately.","t":"有太多的變數無法準確預測結果。"},{"w":"intricate","p":"adj.","d":"having many small parts and details","c":"錯綜複雜的","s":"The artist drew an intricate design on the paper.","t":"那位藝術家在紙上畫出錯綜複雜的圖案。"},{"w":"proficient","p":"adj.","d":"skilled and good at something","c":"熟練的","s":"She is proficient in both English and Japanese.","t":"她在英語和日語方面都很熟練。"},{"w":"proficiency","p":"n.","d":"a high level of skill in something","c":"熟練程度","s":"He showed his proficiency in playing the piano.","t":"他展現了他在彈鋼琴方面的熟練程度。"},{"w":"occur","p":"v.","d":"to happen","c":"發生","s":"Many accidents occur on this road.","t":"在這條路上發生了許多事故。"},{"w":"occurrence","p":"n.","d":"something that happens","c":"事件；發生","s":"The occurrence of the storm surprised everyone.","t":"這場暴風雨的發生讓大家都很驚訝。"},{"w":"counterfeit","p":"adj.","d":"made to look real to trick people; fake","c":"偽造的","s":"The police found many counterfeit bills in the shop.","t":"警方在商店裡發現了許多偽造的鈔票。"}]}];
